# rawkvm hidrec v1
# Two receivers (phase 6, ADR 0030): the Logitech C52B of the Pi (ids 0, 1)
# and another vendor's 2.4 GHz receiver, 248a:8367 (ids 16, 17). The second
# one's descriptors are the Logitech ones reused: synthetic, for tests and
# the simulated hub. Replay with a config that has both blocks, e.g.
#   [[receiver]]
#   name = "logitech"
#   [[receiver]]
#   name = "other"
#   vid = 0x248a
# Input: "a" on the Logitech keyboard, "b" on the other one, a small move
# of each mouse.
